@startuml 答卷评分状态图
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor<<submit>> #E3F2FD
  BackgroundColor<<wait>> #FFF3E0
  BackgroundColor<<complete>> #E8F5E9
}

title 答卷评分状态图\nExamPaperAnswer.status (ExamPaperAnswerStatusEnum)

state "待批改\nWaitJudge(1)" as waitJudge <<wait>>
state "完成\nComplete(2)" as complete <<complete>>

[*] --> waitJudge : calculateExamPaperAnswer()\n存在主观题(GapFilling/ShortAnswer)
[*] --> complete : calculateExamPaperAnswer()\n全部为客观题(SingleChoice/MultipleChoice/TrueFalse)

waitJudge --> complete : ExamPaperAnswerServiceImpl.judge()\n管理员批改主观题后\nstatus = Complete(2)

note right of [*]
  评分逻辑 (calculateExamPaperAnswer):
  ─────────────────────────────
  SingleChoice(1): answer == correct → doRight
  MultipleChoice(2): 完全匹配 → doRight
  TrueFalse(3): answer == correct → doRight
  GapFilling(4): customerScore=0, 待批改
  ShortAnswer(5): customerScore=0, 待批改

  needSaveTextContent() == true
  ⇒ status = WaitJudge(1)
  否则 ⇒ status = Complete(2)
end note

note right of complete
  事件: CalculateExamPaperAnswerCompleteEvent
  监听器: CalculateExamPaperAnswerListener
  持久化: ExamPaperAnswer + ExamPaperQuestionCustomerAnswer
  关联: 若 paperType == Task(6)
        → 更新 TaskExamCustomerAnswer
end note

@enduml
